{"id":50210,"date":"2026-03-28T06:47:16","date_gmt":"2026-03-28T05:47:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50210"},"modified":"2026-09-13T12:32:56","modified_gmt":"2026-09-13T11:32:56","slug":"trail-rios-e-levadas-teaga-aventura","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-rios-e-levadas-teaga-aventura\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Rios e Levadas Teaga Aventura 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Rios e Levadas Teaga Aventura 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Rios e Levadas Teaga Aventura 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na pitoresca aldeia de <strong>Santa Cruz &#8211; Arcozelo das Maias<\/strong>, no concelho de Oliveira de Frades. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica de Santa Cruz<\/strong> com o apoio principal da <strong>Teaga<\/strong>, o evento convida os atletas a descobrir trilhos m\u00e1gicos serpenteados por levadas ancestrais, linhas de \u00e1gua cristalinas e encostas florestais da regi\u00e3o de Laf\u00f5es.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada instaladas junto \u00e0 sede da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica de Santa Cruz<\/strong>, a prova oferece o <strong>Trail Longo 21K (1000m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto 14K (650m D+)<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada 10K (500m D+)<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza cronometragem Stop and Go por chip, dorsal personalizado, t-shirt comemorativa oficial, refor\u00e7o nos postos de abastecimento, banhos com \u00e1gua quente e trof\u00e9us para os primeiros classificados individuais e coletivos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/l